  + [processed_stage_set] is source_preserved, delineated, researched, exploded, data_designed, semantically_refined, constraint_checked, pruned, seven_fold_phase_locked, justified, planned, registry_ready, and signed
  + [constraint_check] is passed against parent build authority, execution surface authority, OpenAI Codex MCP support, MCP schema, and official Rust SDK
  + [pruning_trace] is HTTP, plugin UI, effects, resident service, trust mutation, adapter-local semantics, and configuration mutation excluded
  + [exhaustion_state] is seven_fold_phase_locked_for_one_local_read_only_tool

